 "probe": {
  "status": 200,
  "final_url": "https://duckbutt.lexdemos.com/faq/",
  "title": "Your Page Title",
  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Duckbutt Barbers Journal Overview Book a chair Menu Book a chair Prices Barbers Looks Memberships Journal The shop About Gift cards Careers FAQ Contact Visit Laugavegur 42 101 Reykjav\u00edk Tuesday to Friday, 10 to 19 Saturday, 10 to 17 Look of the week Skin fade \u00a9 2026 Duckbutt Terms Privacy Cookies FAQ The things people ask us most, from the chair and on the phone. Anything else, just write to us . Booking Do I need to book? No. Walk-ins are welcome whenever a chair is free, until an hour before closing. Bookings go first, so on Saturdays it helps. Can I choose my barber? Yes. Pick them when you book, or ask for them at the door. If they are busy we will tell you how long the wait is. What if I am running late? Call us. Up to ten minutes we can usually still do the full cut. After that we may need to shorten it or move you. How do I cancel? Through the link in your confirmation, or by phone. It is free up to 12 hours before. After that we charge half the price. At the shop Do you cut long hair? Yes. Sigr\u00fan specialises in scissor cuts for longer hair. Book the long hair cut so we give it the full hour. Do you cut kids&#39; hair? Kids under 12 are welcome any day. Freyj",
